  "label": "Agent skills",
  "intent": "A skill cartridge is loaded into its dock. Light: the cartridge drops into the dock and lands with a hit; the dock takes the load, giving under it with the cartridge, and both spring back and settle with the cartridge seated. Strong: the cartridge is lifted first, then driven down harder; the dock gives further and the pair settle in two beats. Eject: the cartridge is pulled up, dragging the dock a little, then pops free; the dock snaps back with a rebound and the cartridge settles above it. Cartridge and dock stay rigid.",
